			_descs[1] = ""Smooth Controller for the SOUL in battle, including battles inside Ch5's side-scrolling sections. Allows 360 degree movement instead of keyboard emulation. GRADUAL: speed increases based on how far you move the stick past the dead zone. FULL: always full speed past the dead zone."";
			_descs[2] = ""Shows a debug readout (room name and number, FPS, coordinates) in the top-left corner. Turn this ON to report exactly where a bug happens."";
			_descs[3] = ""Enables the V key to fast-forward the game. Pick 2X or 4X, then press V during play to toggle the speed-up on and off. OFF disables the key."";
			_descs[4] = ""Ch5 platformer only: pixel-perfect smooth camera + crisp sprites in the side-scrolling sections. PIXEL (default): integer scale, sharpest image, may add black borders (fills the window on small displays). ON: fills the window. Turn OFF if you notice any visual glitches."";
			_descs[5] = ""How fast holding the CANCEL button (The C key by default) skips through text. OFF: normal speed. ON: faster (the quicker skip from earlier versions)."";
			_descs[6] = ""Ch5 platformer, Smooth Camera OFF only. OFF: normal. ON: snaps Kris, Susie and Ralsei to the art's 2-pixel grid (less shimmer at 1080p, steppier movement)."";
